# Admin app build-time settings (copy to apps/admin/.env.production or set in the host's build env).
#
# Development: leave unset. Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:4000, so admin and API are same-origin.
# Vercel (vercel.json services): leave unset. /api/* is routed to the API on the same domain.
# Separate hosts: the API's public URL, on the same registrable domain as the admin
# (admin.<domain> → api.<domain>), otherwise the refresh cookie is blocked. See README "Hosting & cookies".
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.sakthimaan.in
